          // matrix where the keyframe said none, or carry float residue
          // (translateY(8.9e-16px)). Under the shell's scale a transform
          // that is not none moves an edge by a fraction of a pixel, so a
          // finished run would not paint like final(): settle on the
          // authored end values instead.
